@startuml UC28A_ViewGuests
!theme plain
title UC28A: Xem danh sách khách

actor Staff as "Staff/Admin"
participant "Admin Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend API" as API
database "Database" as DB

Staff -> Frontend: Truy cập trang "Quản lý khách"
Frontend -> API: GET /api/v1/bookings\n(Authorization: Bearer token)\n(query params: page, limit, populate guests)

API -> API: Verify JWT + Check role (staff/admin)
API -> DB: Query bookings\n(populate guests, roomId, customerId)\n(filter deleted bookings)

DB --> API: Bookings với guests data

API -> API: Extract guests từ bookings\n(flatten guests array, mark mainGuest)
API -> API: Apply filters\n(name, email, phoneNumber nếu có)

API --> Frontend: Success + guests list + pagination
Frontend --> Staff: Hiển thị danh sách khách\n(lọc theo tên/email/SĐT)
@enduml

